	(text "Not hooking up 5V or 3V3 as some mikroeboards dont block backfeeding, \nlike the 3v3 on the https://www.mikroe.com/clicker-4-for-stm32f745vgt6\n\nCheck 3v3 LDO on the stm32f7: NCP186 datasheet \"The PMOS pass transistor has an inherent body diode\nwhich will be forward biased in the case when VOUT > VIN .\nDue to this fact in cases, where the extended reverse current\ncondition can be anticipated the device may require\nadditional external protection.\""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
